{"protocol":"mindblown-brain/1","brain":"projects","page":{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","title":"Tidewatch Forecast Engine","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":"projects/tidewatch","desc":"Blends public marine forecasts into a single hourly wind, swell and tide timeline with confidence bands.","intro":"Blends public marine forecasts into a single hourly wind, swell and tide timeline with confidence bands.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-22","synapses":["projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#1","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#2","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#3","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#4","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#5","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#6","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#7","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#8","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#9","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#10","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#11","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#12","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#13","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#14","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#15","projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#16"],"sources":["pplx://sessions/fa2c58cf-2d9e-fb01-76f7-f4587bd38a84","pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/31","https://example-print.test/proof-guidelines"],"sections":["How it works","See also"]},"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch-forecast-engine","parent":{"id":"projects/tidewatch","title":"Tidewatch","type":"project","lobe":"tide","parent":null,"desc":"Tidewatch is Sam Vale's sailing weather and tide planner for small-boat day trips, with a hosted web app and an offline phone build.","created":"2026-10-08","updated":"2026-10-18","synapses":22,"sources":5,"children":7,"links":13,"url":"https://mindblown.pplx.app/index.html#n=projects%2Ftidewatch","api":"api/projects/v1/pages/projects~2ftidewatch.json"},"children":[],"synapses":[{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#1","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Tide gate is not acceptance","text":"the tide gate exports in the hosted app and surfaces a plain warning when the arrival window is missing. Manual confirmation is still required.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#2","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Bounded crew list evidence","text":"the tide gate is derived from the crew list before departure; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#3","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Arrival window is not acceptance","text":"Sam chose to keep the arrival window and the wind polar distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#4","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Depth sounding is not acceptance","text":"depth sounding changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the hosted app is bounded evidence, not proof that the wind polar works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#5","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"No silent crew list changes","text":"an earlier draft treated the crew list as complete; later turns supersede that, and the current state is a tested candidate awaiting the owner's go-ahead.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#6","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Harbour chart is not acceptance","text":"the harbour chart exports in the hosted app, but this does not establish swell model acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/paper-moons-website"],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#7","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Default-off small-craft alert","text":"Sam chose to keep the small-craft alert and the crew list distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/fa2c58cf-2d9e-fb01-76f7-f4587bd38a84"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#8","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Small-craft alert before float plan","text":"the float plan is derived from the small-craft alert per harbour; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/fa2c58cf-2d9e-fb01-76f7-f4587bd38a84","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/31"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#9","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Bounded small-craft alert evidence","text":"the wind polar is derived from the small-craft alert on the phone; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#10","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Separate small-craft alert ownership","text":"the swell model is derived from the small-craft alert on the phone; exports include it, imports tolerate its absence and nothing is deleted on the way through.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["pplx://sessions/fa2c58cf-2d9e-fb01-76f7-f4587bd38a84"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#11","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Bounded small-craft alert evidence","text":"Sam chose to keep the small-craft alert and the harbour chart distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/31"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#12","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Protected offline cache","text":"Sam chose to keep the offline cache and the harbour chart distinct so neither substitutes for the other. The decision was recorded with the session that produced it.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/tidewatch-offline-charts"],"cites":["https://example-print.test/proof-guidelines"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#13","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Tide gate snapshots per harbour","text":"tide gate changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check per harbour is bounded evidence, not proof that the small-craft alert works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":["projects/tidewatch-beta-crew"],"cites":["pplx://sessions/b0b7e1a5-010a-2d85-d804-4822b5c0bec0"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#14","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"One wind polar, two surfaces","text":"the wind polar exports before departure, but this does not establish swell model acceptance or a new release. Review notes remain separate from the shipped build.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":[]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#15","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Offline cache before arrival window","text":"offline cache changes are reviewed before merge; a passing check in the hosted app is bounded evidence, not proof that the arrival window works for every user.","section":"How it works","links":[],"cites":["https://example-print.test/proof-guidelines","https://git.example.test/sam-vale/tidewatch/pull/31"]},{"id":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine#16","page":"projects/tidewatch-forecast-engine","lead":"Depth sounding stays 